[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3342431738","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110991#issuecomment-3342431738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110991","id":3342431738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HOXX6","user":{"login":"Galo223344","id":46462621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDYyNjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46462621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344","html_url":"https://github.com/Galo223344","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-28T07:08:43Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T07:08:43Z","body":"Note that this only happens if a pixel touches the border of the image","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3342431738/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3343583846","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110991#issuecomment-3343583846","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110991","id":3343583846,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HSwpm","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-28T14:36:04Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T14:36:04Z","body":"- Related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/93215.\n\nThis is a consequence of the texture's contents touching the edges of the texture.\n\n<img width=\"251\" height=\"168\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d5c7c3f3-572e-4bbc-913f-3a07106344a6\" />\n\nThis is why it looks like this in the Sprite2D that renders the AtlasTexture:\n\n<img width=\"314\" height=\"259\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da6e3087-373c-4bc4-8f60-b56105b0c3b3\" />\n\nIf you enable **Repeat** on the Sprite2D, the issue will go away (but you'll see copies of the atlas texture appear instead):\n\n<img width=\"314\" height=\"259\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4a4f1f92-c56c-4e23-8662-c1b85cc39768\" />\n\nIf you want to avoid this issue entirely, make sure you have a fully transparent line of pixels on each side of the atlas texture source.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3343583846/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3344221907","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110991#issuecomment-3344221907","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110991","id":3344221907,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HVMbT","user":{"login":"Galo223344","id":46462621,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDYyNjIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46462621?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344","html_url":"https://github.com/Galo223344","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Galo223344/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-28T20:21:55Z","updated_at":"2025-09-28T20:24:23Z","body":"Yes, that's what I resorted to doing, but it's more of a workaround than a fix. It also doesn't explain why changing the region of the atlasTexture fixes the issue as the pixel is still touching the edge of the texture.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3344221907/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"